<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT-Nova said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Nova said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating of NOVA Corp on Monday to an outperform from a neutral, according to a source.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 22-1/2.</p>
</text>
